{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'ls -a; cat AGENTS.md 2>/dev/null; cat README.md; cat linuxgcb/policy.py'","aggregated_output":".\n..\n.agents\n.aws\n.codex\n.git\n.gitignore\nCODEX_BATCH1_HANDOFF.md\nCODEX_HANDOFF.md\nCODEX_HANDOFF_FIX1.md\nCODEX_HANDOFF_REPORT1.md\nCODEX_QUALITY1_HANDOFF.md\nNEXT_STEPS.md\nPLAN.md\nREADME.md\nRed Hat Enterprise Linux 9政府組態基準列表.xlsx\nTWGCB-01-012_Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9政府組態基準說明文件(伺服器)v1.2_1140612.docx\ncodex_exp1.log\ncodex_fix1.log\ncodex_report1.log\ndata\ndocs\nlinuxgcb\npolicies\nscripts\ntemplates\ntests\n# LinuxGCB Q1：既有 53 項候選品質整併\n\n僅離線開發，分支 `codex/linuxgcb-quality1`。來源 314 項 = 307 候選 + 7 排除；固定數字 ID 不變，僅審查既有 53 項，沒有擴充控制或 Dashboard。完整結論見 [Q1 審查](docs/QUALITY_REVIEW_Q1.md)。歷史交接保留原樣，過去 full 數量不代表本次核准。\n\n目前 coverage **full 0／partial 48／blocked 5**；53 項 execution_review 均 blocked，真機驗證 0、來源核准 0。離線審查已完成並記錄問題，不表示 review pass。非零退出且 stdout 符合仍可能 raw PASS；原生命令沒有已驗證的執行狀態保護。未新增 helper 或端點人工步驟。\n\nPython 3.10+ 標準函式庫，無安裝與網路需求：\n\n```bash\npython3 -m linuxgcb build\npython3 -m linuxgcb validate\npython3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v\npython3 -m linuxgcb report tests/fixtures/snapshot.json --out out/q1-synthetic --now 2026-10-30T00:00:00Z\n```\n\nCLI 不執行政策命令。build 核對 XLSX/DOCX hash，重建 registry、三份候選政策、policy hashes 與 schema v2 coverage manifest。`reviewed` 包含全部 53 項來源 DOCX cells、問題代碼與處置；validate 重算對帳，並非 Wazuh YAML／PCRE2 驗收。原始 XLSX、DOCX、controls.json、inventory.json 不修改。\n\n報表保存 raw_result、raw_reason、evidence_status、coverage、execution_review、verified_compliance。raw passed 在 blocked／partial 時為 MANUAL_PENDING；raw failed 保留候選 FAIL 觀察，但不列完整符合判定。完整率只計 verified_compliance；目前為 0%。有效核准不適用需 approver、reason、ticket、evidence、expires；錯誤不能藉核准 N/A 隱藏。缺少備份檔或服務不自動 PASS／FAIL／核准 N/A；輸入明確 missing／absence_unverified 時列待審，tool_error／permission_error／timeout 為 ERROR。無法分類的原始結果仍保留，不能藉缺失原因推測適用性。\n\n合成 fixture 僅有 6 筆原始觀察，53 項候選的 authored 數量不算 scanned。`out/` 的 HTML、CSV、summary.json 與原始 snapshot.json 為忽略產物；同名輸出會覆寫。測試固定時間不能用於正式資料。\n\n模擬器只支援實際發出的 all、c:/f: 正向單一 r:，模式限現有規則與 ASCII literal；拒絕 any／none、其他運算子與未驗證語法。逐 LF 行搜尋，退出碼與 stderr 不提供保護；Python regex 並非 PCRE2。CRLF、Unicode、Wazuh 的緩衝／stderr／timeout／argv 與錯誤辨識都須真機驗證。\n\n有效 Wazuh 依據為 docs/references 內 creating-custom-policies、how-it-works、how-to-configure、internal-options 快照；sca-custom-policies 是 soft404，不作依據。本次無外網查詢、SSH、生產 API、秘密、sudo、安裝、服務變更或 Excel remediation。`sca.remote_commands=1` 沿用已核准的一次性 Agent 安裝 bootstrap，並非集中 agent.conf 開關。\n\nHermes 負責獨立驗收、整合與溝通。本次留下未提交 diff，不主張父代理接受；後續限 [NEXT_STEPS](NEXT_STEPS.md) 的 Q1 驗收。\n\n## REPORT-1：Manager DB 真實快照（離線）\n\n`tests/fixtures/realhost_r2.json` 為 **REAL EVIDENCE agent010**，逐位元複製 R2 原始匯出，非合成資料。53 筆觀察為 46 passed／7 failed；label 由 snapshot 加入，不改寫 fixture。其他合成 fixture 僅供 test-only。\n\n```bash\npython3 -m linuxgcb snapshot tests/fixtures/realhost_r2.json --out out/report1-r2/snapshot.json\npython3 -m linuxgcb report out/report1-r2/snapshot.json --out out/report1-r2/report\n```\n\n輸入為 `{policy_id: {scan_id, checks: [...]}}`。若另有同次離線 `sca_scan_info`，使用 `--scan-info path.json`，格式為 `{policy_id: {\"end_scan\": \"2026-10-31T04:03:00Z\"}}`（此為格式範例，不能冒作本次實測時間），也接受 UTC epoch 秒。時間僅按 policy_id 對應；不得將 sca_scan_info.hash join sca_check.scan_id。匯出應使用各政策最新 scan：`select scan_id from sca_check where policy_id=? group by scan_id order by max(rowid) desc limit 1`。Manager 4.14 不使用已移除的 `/sca/{agent}/checks`。\n\n目前 R2 原始檔沒有 sca_scan_info，故 scanned_at=null、stale=true 並顯示警示；必須提供離線時間證據才能補齊。現有 policies/*.yml 沒有 remediation，原始匯出同欄為 null；報表保留空值並明示「政策未提供 remediation」，不產生修復指令。本批未修改政策。7 FAIL 仍逐項顯示 TWGCB ID、title、command 與 remediation 欄；UNVALIDATED 的 raw passed 不算已驗證符合。詳見 [REPORT-1 審查](docs/REPORT1_REVIEW.md)。\n\"\"\"以 JSON（YAML 1.2 子集）產生候選 SCA；只模擬輸出匹配，不執行命令。\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport re\nfrom functools import lru_cache\nfrom .catalog import ROOT, registry, digest\nfrom .batch1 import rules as batch_rules, disabled_service_rules\n\n\ndef definitions():\n    modes = '|'.join(format(n, 'o') for n in range(0o1000) if n & ~0o644 == 0)\n    return {**batch_rules(),\n        45: [('c:/usr/bin/stat -c %u:%g /etc/passwd', '^0:0$')],\n        46: [('c:/usr/bin/stat -c %a /etc/passwd', '^('+modes+')$')],\n        108: [('c:/usr/sbin/sysctl -n net.ipv4.ip_forward', '^0$'),\n              ('c:/usr/sbin/sysctl -n net.ipv6.conf.all.forwarding', '^0$')],\n        243: [('c:/usr/bin/systemctl show firewalld.service --property=LoadState', '^LoadState=loaded$'),\n              ('c:/usr/bin/systemctl show firewalld.service --property=ActiveState', '^ActiveState=active$'),\n              ('c:/usr/bin/systemctl show firewalld.service --property=UnitFileState', '^UnitFileState=enabled$')],\n        245: disabled_service_rules('nftables'),\n        269: [('c:/usr/sbin/sshd -T', '^permitrootlogin no$')],\n        270: [('c:/usr/sbin/sshd -T', '^permitemptypasswords no$')],\n    }\n\n\ndef build():\n    rows = registry()\n    for profile in ('base', 'firewalld', 'sshd'):\n        filename = 'linuxgcb_'+profile+'.yml'\n        checks = []\n        for row in rows:\n            if row['implementation'] != 'candidate' or row['profile'] != profile:\n                continue\n            checks.append(dict(id=row['sca_id'], title=row['gcb_id']+' '+row['title'],\n                description='Q1 執行審查 '+row['execution_review']+'；coverage='+row['coverage']+'；'+','.join(row['issue_ids'])+'；raw PASS 非已驗證符合。'+row['pending'],\n                compliance=[{'twgcb': [row['gcb_id']]}], regex_type='pcre2', condition='all',\n                rules=[target+' -> r:'+pattern for target, pattern in definitions()[int(row['gcb_id'][-4:])]]))\n        policy = dict(policy=dict(id='linuxgcb_rhel9_'+profile+'_v01', file=filename,\n                      name='RHEL9 GCB v1.2 '+profile+' v0.1 UNVALIDATED',\n                      description='未驗證候選政策；僅供核准 RHEL9 試點，非完整符合性檢核', regex_type='pcre2'),\n                      requirements=dict(title='僅 RHEL 9', description='角色由核准群組控制',\n                        condition='all', rules=['f:/etc/os-release -> r:^ID=\"?rhel\"?$',\n                                               'f:/etc/os-release -> r:^VERSION_ID=\"?9([.][0-9]+)*\"?$']),\n                      checks=checks)\n        (ROOT/'policies'/filename).write_text(json.dumps(policy, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)+'\\n')\n    hashes = {p.name: digest(p) for p in sorted((ROOT/'policies').glob('*.yml'))}\n    (ROOT/'data/policy_hashes.json').write_text(json.dumps(hashes, indent=2)+'\\n')\n    from .coverage import write\n    write()\n    validate()\n\n\ndef require(condition):\n    if not condition:\n        raise ValueError('候選政策結構、mapping 或 hash 不符')\n\n\ndef validate():\n    rows = {r['sca_id']: r for r in registry()}\n    seen = set()\n    for path in sorted((ROOT/'policies').glob('*.yml')):\n        p = json.loads(path.read_text())\n        require(p['policy']['file'] == path.name and p['policy']['regex_type']=='pcre2')\n        require(p['requirements'] == dict(title='僅 RHEL 9', description='角色由核准群組控制',\n            condition='all', rules=['f:/etc/os-release -> r:^ID=\"?rhel\"?$',\n                                   'f:/etc/os-release -> r:^VERSION_ID=\"?9([.][0-9]+)*\"?$']))\n        for c in p['checks']:\n            require(c['id'] not in seen and rows[c['id']]['included'])\n            seen.add(c['id'])\n            require(c['regex_type'] == 'pcre2' and c['condition'] == 'all')\n            require(c['compliance'] == [{'twgcb': [rows[c['id']]['gcb_id']]}])\n            require(rows[c['id']]['policy_id'] == p['policy']['id'])\n            require(c['rules'] == [a+' -> r:'+b for a,b in definitions()[c['id']-900000]])\n            for rule in c['rules']:\n                target, pattern = rule.split(' -> r:')\n                require(target.startswith('c:/') and not any(x in target for x in ('|',';', '&&', '$', '`')))\n                parse_rule(rule)\n    require(seen == {900000+n for n in definitions()})\n    hashes = json.loads((ROOT/'data/policy_hashes.json').read_text())\n    require(hashes == {p.name:digest(p) for p in (ROOT/'policies').glob('*.yml')})\n    from .coverage import manifest\n    require(json.loads((ROOT/'data/coverage_manifest.json').read_text()) == manifest())\n    require(seen == {r['sca_id'] for r in rows.values() if r['implementation']=='candidate'})\n    return len(seen)\n\n\n@lru_cache(maxsize=1)\ndef supported_patterns():\n    return frozenset(p for rules in definitions().values() for _,p in rules) | {\n        '^ID=\"?rhel\"?$', '^VERSION_ID=\"?9([.][0-9]+)*\"?$'}\n\n\ndef parse_rule(rule):\n    \"\"\"明確有界子集：絕對路徑 c:/f: + 單一正向 r:；拒絕其他運算子。\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(rule, str) or rule.count(' -> r:') != 1:\n        raise ValueError('不支援的規則語法')\n    target, pattern = rule.split(' -> r:')\n    if not re.fullmatch(r'[cf]:/[^\\n\\r]+', target) or any(x in target for x in (' -> ', ' && ', '|', ';', '`', '$')):\n        raise ValueError('不支援的目標')\n    # Python 並非 PCRE2；只接受實際發出的固定模式與測試用 ASCII literal。\n    if pattern not in supported_patterns() and not re.fullmatch(r'\\^[A-Za-z0-9_ =:/-]+\\$', pattern):\n        raise ValueError('未驗證的 PCRE2 語法')\n    try:\n        return target, re.compile(pattern, re.ASCII)\n    except re.error as exc:\n        raise ValueError('無效模式') from exc\n\n\ndef simulate(check, observations):\n    \"\"\"僅輸出匹配模型；執行失敗資訊不足回 UNRESOLVED，不冒充 Wazuh。\n\n    FIX-1 同一 command 的多行輸出仍按逐行存在匹配；alternation 是單一\n    正向 regex，規則間維持 all，不以空輸出或 stderr 推論 not-found。\n    exit_code 不參與 SCA 輸出匹配。明確 engine_result 可表示真機／fixture\n    的 Not applicable；error 只表示未取得可靠輸出，不能預測引擎結果。\n    \"\"\"\n    if check.get('regex_type', 'pcre2') != 'pcre2':\n        raise ValueError('只支援明確 PCRE2 候選子集')\n    if check.get('condition') != 'all':\n        raise ValueError('輸出模型只支援目前發出的 all 子集')\n    if not isinstance(check.get('rules'), list) or not check['rules']:\n        raise ValueError('規則不得為空')\n    parsed = [parse_rule(rule) for rule in check['rules']]\n    outcomes = []\n    for target, pattern in parsed:\n        obs = observations.get(target)\n        if target.startswith('f:') and obs is not None and obs.get('exists') is False:\n            outcomes.append('NOT_APPLICABLE')\n            continue\n        if obs is None or obs.get('error'):\n            outcomes.append('UNRESOLVED')\n        elif obs.get('engine_result') == 'NOT_APPLICABLE':\n            outcomes.append('NOT_APPLICABLE')\n        elif not isinstance(obs.get('stdout'), str):\n            raise ValueError('觀察必須提供字串 stdout')\n        else:\n            outcomes.append('PASS' if any(pattern.search(line) for line in obs['stdout'].split('\\n')) else 'FAIL')\n    # 官方 all：任何 FAIL 優先；未知執行不擅自轉成 N/A。\n    if 'FAIL' in outcomes:\n        return 'FAIL'\n    if 'UNRESOLVED' in outcomes:\n        return 'UNRESOLVED'\n    return 'NOT_APPLICABLE' if 'NOT_APPLICABLE' in outcomes else 'PASS'\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
